Subject: Replace MimeType=inode/directory in filelight's desktop entry with StartupWMClass=org.kde.filelight

The class names the app_id Filelight's window carries, its desktop file
name. With MimeType=inode/directory a folder could open in the disk-usage
view instead of the file manager.

--- a/misc/org.kde.filelight.desktop
+++ b/misc/org.kde.filelight.desktop
@@ -231,6 +231,6 @@
 Keywords[uk]=disk;drive;space;storage;usage;диск;пристрій;місце;зберігання;сховище;використання;вжиток;
 Keywords[zh_CN]=disk;drive;space;storage;usage;磁盘;驱动器;存储;空间;容量;占用;使用率;占用率;空间占用;剩余空间;cipan;qudongqi;cunchu;kongjian;rongliang;zhanyong;shiyonglv;zhanyonglv;kongjianzhanyong;shengyukongjian;
 Keywords[zh_TW]=disk;drive;space;storage;usage;磁碟用量;硬碟用量;
-MimeType=inode/directory;
+StartupWMClass=org.kde.filelight
 X-DocPath=filelight/index.html
 Categories=Qt;KDE;Utility;
